ar (revenue declined; volume only ~4% vs ~10% guided) driven by external shocks — lower realizations (pass-through of cheap 2025-crop raw material), Middle East/vessel-availability disruption in March, tomato crop failure, and a high base (Kumbh Mela beverage demand in Q4 FY25). Management's stance: cyclical externals mask a structurally diversifying platform; FY27 guided to ~18% volume growth led by frozen.","trig":[]},"lm":"","m":396,"mem":0,"pdd":"","prev_stage":1,"prev_zone_vpe":-1.7,"r":null,"s":"FOODSIN","sig":"","sx":{"SMA_50":"56.3","base_count":"","drawdown_from_prev_signal":"","duration_from_prev_signal":"","pct_below_52w_high":"47.0","pct_change_from_prev_signal":"","pivot_close":"","pivot_low":"","stage_changed_since_prev_signal":"","vpe_df_60d_sum":"-0.5","vpe_zone_cumul_df":""},"t":""}},"s":"FOODSIN"}